{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7d9db87c-9934-8b38-b85a-5c76619e3191",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T12:22:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nora Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:17:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:17:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. I have a question about a short-term rental license? I think that's what it's called."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:17:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Short-term rental license, okay. What's the situation, you have a property you want to rent out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:17:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sort of. It's an in-law apartment, attached to our house, on the back side. We don't have anybody in it. I'd want to rent it out on weekends only. Like Friday to Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:17:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Weekends only. Okay. And is this your own house, you own it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:17:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Own it, yes. Me and my husband. Um, one eighty-nine Harrison Avenue, over on the Fort Adams side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:17:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One eighty-nine Harrison. Got it. So yes, in Newport, if you're renting a place for short stays, you generally need to be licensed for it. It's not something you just start doing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:18:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Licensed for it. Okay. So I was looking online and there's, like, a rental registration and then a short-term one, and I wasn't sure if weekends counts as short-term or if that's more like, a month."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:18:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Short-term is the stays of a few nights, a week, that kind of thing. Friday to Sunday is short-term. The long lease, month to month or a year, is a different animal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:18:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A different animal. Okay. So mine is the short one. The short-term license."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:18:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:18:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And, so, does somebody have to come inspect it? Is an inspection needed? Before I could rent it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:18:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Typically yes, there's a safety inspection part of it. Smoke detectors, carbon monoxide, exits, that sort of thing. Especially for an in-law unit, they'll want to look at how it's set up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:19:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How it's set up. Hold on, sorry, the trash truck just went by, it's trash day on our street, I'm trying to hear you. [pause] Okay, it's moving on. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:19:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Happens Mondays, I guess, over there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:19:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, Mondays. Okay. So the in-law part. It's already got a kitchen. Does that matter? Because I wasn't sure if it was legally, like, an apartment or just a room."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:19:34-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It matters, yeah. Whether that unit is recognized as a separate dwelling unit, that's a zoning question. Some in-law setups are approved as accessory units, some are just part of the house. I can't tell you which yours is off the top of my head."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:19:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Which mine is. Hm. So how would I find out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:19:58-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We can look at the records for the address. What I'd do is have someone pull the file for one eighty-nine Harrison and see what was approved when it was built or changed. That's step one before you apply for anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:20:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Step one before I apply. Okay. And I don't know if my husband has paperwork on that. We bought the house a couple years ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:20:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Might be in your closing papers, but the city file is the better answer anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:20:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The city file. Okay. And then the license, is that through you, or is it a different office? Because I got bounced around on the website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The license application goes through the city clerk's side generally, but the zoning check and the inspection come through us. So you'll deal with both. Start with us on the zoning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:20:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Start with you on the zoning. Both offices. Okay. Sorry, so the inspection, would that be before the license or after?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:21:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before it's issued. You don't get the license and then get inspected. They'd want it to pass first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:21:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pass first. Okay, I had it backwards. I thought I could apply and they'd come after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:21:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, other way around. Now, can I get a number for you? I'll have somebody call you back about pulling that file, and they can tell you what to bring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:21:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, yes. It's four oh one, five five five, oh one nine five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:21:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one nine five. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:21:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nora Dolan. D-O-L-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:21:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nora Dolan, one eighty-nine Harrison, short-term rental on an in-law unit, wants to know the zoning status and the inspection. That about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:21:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Um, the zoning status and the inspection. And, sorry, one more. If it turns out it's not an official apartment, can I still do it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:22:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the thing they'll have to tell you after they see the file. It might mean some other steps first. I don't want to say yes or no without looking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:22:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Without looking. Okay. That's fair. So I should wait for the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:22:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, wait for the call. Probably today or tomorrow, but with the holiday this week it could slip a day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:22:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Slip a day or two. Right, Christmas. Okay. Thank you, Greg. I think I understand it. Mostly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:22:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'll get the rest on the callback. Take care, Nora."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T12:22:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
